OL,3,GNEWSABotman banned from driving for    
OL,4,Ausing phone at wheel                   
OL,6,FHe was fined #900 and ordered to pay   
OL,7,F#400 costs and a #360 victim surcharge,
OL,8,Fthe MoJ said.                          
